      "title": "JEE Main 2019 (09 Jan Shift 2)"
    }
  ],
  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "In a car race on straight road, car <math><mi>A</mi></math> takes a time <math><mi>t</mi></math> less than car <math><mi>B</mi></math> at the finish and passes finishing point with a speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math>&nbsp;more than that of car <math><mi>B</mi><mo>.</mo></math> Both the cars start from rest and travel with constant acceleration <math><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> &nbsp;respectively. Then <em><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math></em> is equal to:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "4o3Yh",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mi>t</mi></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0Woev",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>t</mi></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5LuCq",
      "text": "<math><msqrt><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></msqrt><mi>t</mi></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "saNOE",
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></msqrt><mi>t</mi></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,&nbsp;<br />Initially both car is at rest, so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Acceleration of car&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br /><br />Let us assume,<br />Time of reach to destination of car&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math><br />Time of reach to destination of car&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></math><br /><br />Using second equation of motion, we have<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mrow><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />From first equation of motion, we have<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi>t</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mrow><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>t</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow><mrow><msub><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
